{"id":"B1-L002","title":"Verb pattern: want someone to do — form","cefr":"B1","level":"B1","unit":"B1-U01","focus":"want someone to do — forma","targets":{"grammar":"want someone to do — forma","pron":"Sentence stress","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["classroom silence","raised hand","tough question","open discussion","curious mind","teacher’s tone","class rule","back row","pop quiz","homework check","group work","study tip","encouraging word","turning point","classroom tone","student voice","question time","raised voice"],"field":"Educação","genre":"Conto e trecho de peça","skill":"Escuta","words_min":18},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 2 · Verb pattern: want someone to do — form","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** want someone to do — forma.","**Pronúncia:** Sentence stress.","**18 palavras novas** (educação).","**Texto do dia:** conto e trecho de peça."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B1):** eu consigo dizer o que quero que alguém faça (want / need / expect / would like + objeto + to)."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["classroom silence","silêncio da sala"],["raised hand","mão levantada"],["tough question","pergunta difícil"],["open discussion","discussão aberta"],["curious mind","mente curiosa"],["teacher’s tone","tom da professora"],["class rule","regra da turma"],["back row","fundo da sala"],["pop quiz","teste surpresa"],["homework check","conferência da lição"],["group work","trabalho em grupo"],["study tip","dica de estudo"],["encouraging word","palavra de incentivo"],["turning point","ponto de virada"],["classroom tone","classroom tone"],["student voice","student voice"],["question time","question time"],["raised voice","raised voice"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short story","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Teacher Who Wanted Them to Ask","paras":["Ms. Reyes **wanted her students to ask** more questions. “I **expect you to say** what you don’t understand,” she told them. But the class stayed silent.","Then Leo raised his hand. “**Would you like us to repeat** the lesson?” “No,” she smiled, “I **would like you to question** it.” From that day, hands went up all the time."],"kicker":"SHORT STORY","by":"A reader","gloss":[["silent","silencioso"],["raise a hand","levantar a mão"],["question","questionar"],["expect","esperar"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Ms. Reyes wanted students to ask more.","ans":"T","why":"wanted her students to ask."},{"q":"The class asked many questions at first.","ans":"F","why":"stayed silent."},{"q":"Leo raised his hand.","ans":"T","why":"raised his hand."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“expect” = ?","opts":["esperar (que)","explicar","exigir só"],"ans":0,"why":"expect."},{"q":"“raise a hand” = ?","opts":["levantar a mão","levar a mão","lavar a mão"],"ans":0,"why":"raise a hand."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"want someone to do","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verbo","Exemplo"],"rows":[["want","**I want you to ask.**"],["expect","**I expect you to say it.**"],["would like","**I would like you to question it.**"],["need","**We need them to repeat.**"],["tell / ask / allow","**She told us to stay.**"]],"cap":"want someone to do"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Estrutura: **verbo + pessoa (objeto) + to + verbo**. Objeto: *me, you, him, her, us, them.* **Nunca**: *want that you ask.*"},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Cuidado","body":"Negativa: **not to**: *I want you not to worry.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"She wanted her students ___ ask. (to)","a":"to","why":"want + obj + to."},{"s":"I expect you ___ say what you think. (to)","a":"to","why":"expect."},{"s":"Would you like us ___ repeat? (to)","a":"to","why":"would like."},{"s":"I want you ___ to worry. (not)","a":"not","why":"not to."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["classroom silence","silêncio da sala"],["raised hand","mão levantada"],["tough question","pergunta difícil"],["shy student","aluno tímido"],["open discussion","discussão aberta"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["I'll","try","OK"],"ans":"OK I'll try","pt":"Certo, vou tentar."},{"words":["want","you","to","ask","questions","I"],"ans":"I want you to ask questions","pt":"Quero que vocês façam perguntas."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"classroom silence","pos":"word","pt":"silêncio da sala","ex":"A classroom silence.","expt":"Um silêncio da sala."},{"w":"raised hand","pos":"word","pt":"mão levantada","ex":"A raised hand.","expt":"Uma mão levantada."},{"w":"tough question","pos":"word","pt":"pergunta difícil","ex":"A tough question.","expt":"Uma pergunta difícil."},{"w":"open discussion","pos":"word","pt":"discussão aberta","ex":"An open discussion.","expt":"Uma discussão aberta."},{"w":"curious mind","pos":"word","pt":"mente curiosa","ex":"A curious mind.","expt":"Uma mente curiosa."},{"w":"teacher’s tone","pos":"word","pt":"tom da professora","ex":"The teacher’s tone.","expt":"O tom da professora."},{"w":"class rule","pos":"word","pt":"regra da turma","ex":"A class rule.","expt":"Uma regra da turma."},{"w":"back row","pos":"word","pt":"fundo da sala","ex":"The back row.","expt":"O fundo da sala."},{"w":"pop quiz","pos":"word","pt":"teste surpresa","ex":"A pop quiz.","expt":"Um teste surpresa."},{"w":"homework check","pos":"word","pt":"conferência da lição","ex":"A homework check.","expt":"Uma conferência da lição."},{"w":"group work","pos":"word","pt":"trabalho em grupo","ex":"Group work.","expt":"Trabalho em grupo."},{"w":"study tip","pos":"word","pt":"dica de estudo","ex":"A study tip.","expt":"Uma dica de estudo."},{"w":"encouraging word","pos":"word","pt":"palavra de incentivo","ex":"An encouraging word.","expt":"Uma palavra de incentivo."},{"w":"turning point","pos":"word","pt":"ponto de virada","ex":"A turning point.","expt":"Um ponto de virada."},{"w":"classroom tone","pos":"word","pt":"classroom tone","ex":"tom da sala","expt":"Classroom tone."},{"w":"student voice","pos":"word","pt":"student voice","ex":"voz do aluno","expt":"Student voice."},{"w":"question time","pos":"word","pt":"question time","ex":"hora das perguntas","expt":"Question time."},{"w":"raised voice","pos":"word","pt":"raised voice","ex":"voz alta","expt":"Raised voice."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Speak up, please.** — Fale mais alto, por favor.","**Don’t be shy.** — Não seja tímido.","**There are no silly questions.** — Não existem perguntas bobas.","**I want you to ask questions.** — Quero que vocês façam perguntas.","**No. I expect you to question it.** — Não. Espero que a questionem.","**OK, I’ll try.** — Certo, vou tentar.","**See eye to eye.** — Concordar plenamente.","**From scratch.** — Do zero."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"collect","pt":"colecionar","forms":[["I / you / we / they collect","I collect stamps."],["he / she / it collects","She collects coins."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Class time","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Class time","lines":[["Teacher","I want you to ask questions.","Quero que vocês façam perguntas."],["Leo","Would you like us to repeat the lesson?","Quer que repitamos a lição?"],["Teacher","No. I expect you to question it.","Não. Espero que a questionem."],["Leo","OK, I’ll try.","Certo, vou tentar."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Sentence stress","items":[{"label":"Sentence stress","note":"Na frase, acentue palavras de conteúdo (substantivos, verbos, adjetivos) e reduza as funcionais: I WANT to LEARN ENglish.","words":["I want to learn English.","She has studied for years.","Can you help me?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you want someone to do.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I want you to help me."},{"q":"Say what you expect.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I expect you to be on time."},{"q":"Use would like + obj + to.","pt":"Use.","model":"I would like you to join us."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with verb + object + to.","model":"Ms. Reyes wanted her students to ask more. I expect you to say what you don’t understand. Would you like us to repeat it? I would like you to question it. I want you not to worry.","checklist":["Usei **obj + to**","Usei **4 verbos**","Usei **not to**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “classroom silence” mean?","opts":["mão levantada","silêncio da sala","aluno tímido"],"ans":1,"why":"**classroom silence** = silêncio da sala."},{"q":"What does “raised hand” mean?","opts":["pergunta difícil","discussão aberta","mão levantada"],"ans":2,"why":"**raised hand** = mão levantada."},{"q":"What does “tough question” mean?","opts":["pergunta difícil","aluno tímido","mente curiosa"],"ans":0,"why":"**tough question** = pergunta difícil."},{"q":"What does “shy student” mean?","opts":["discussão aberta","aluno tímido","plano de aula"],"ans":1,"why":"**shy student** = aluno tímido."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}